# Class probe — exact-resolution-under-condition (budget-scope family)
#
# Competing candidates (verified):
#   - MaxParallelism (internal/types/config.go:92, yaml max_parallelism,
#     DefaultPipelineMaxParallelism=2): the global cap on how many fan-out
#     work units (explorer / reviewer / subagent siblings) run CONCURRENTLY.
#   - PipelineMaxSteps (internal/config/runtime.go:213, yaml
#     pipeline_max_steps, default 50): the TOTAL number of pipeline steps
#     a Run may take — a budget over time, not concurrency.
# The condition "how many run AT THE SAME TIME" selects MaxParallelism;
# PipelineMaxSteps (the total-work budget) is the salient wrong sibling.
ID="cond_resolve_concurrency_cap"
NAME="cond-resolve — cap on concurrent fan-out vs total steps"
QUESTION="限制【同一时刻最多有多少个并行 fan-out 工作单元（explorer/reviewer/subagent 兄弟节点）同时跑】的是哪个配置项？请把它和限制整个 Run 总步数的预算区分开，给出两个参数名。"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(MaxParallelism|max_parallelism|pipeline_max_parallelism)
(并发|并行|同(一)?时(刻|候)|concurrent|at.*same.*time|simultaneous|goroutine)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="zzz_unmatched_sentinel_zzz"
